---
layout = "base"
permalink = "/"
title = ""
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <a
        class="pill pill-version"
        href="{{ site.params.releaseNotes }}"
        aria-label="Pooka {{ site.params.version }} release notes"
      ><span class="tag">v{{ site.params.version }}</span></a>
      <h1>A little magic in <em>every line</em> of code.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Pooka is a small, statically typed language for the BEAM. <strong>Immutable classes, interfaces, enums, pattern matching and actors</strong>, with errors you can hold in your hand, and good manners towards Erlang, Elixir and Gleam.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/getting-started/">Get started</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/tour/">Take the tour</a>
      </div>
      <div class="install" id="install">
        <span class="prompt">$</span>
        <code>{{ site.params.install }}</code>
        <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy>Copy</button>
      </div>
      <p class="install-note">On Windows? Follow the <a href="/docs/install/#3-install-pooka-on-windows">installation guide</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="window">
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">src/main.pooka</span></div>
        <pre><code class="language-pooka">{{ sample("hero") | safe }}</code></pre>
        <div class="terminal"><pre><code>{{ "$ pooka run\n   Compiled 1 module in 0.41s\n    Running lantern.main\nAda is glowing\nBo waits in the dark" | terminal | safe }}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img
        class="mascot"
        src="/assets/mascots/mascot-hero-lantern.png"
        alt="Pooka, a small dark creature with glowing eyes and an orange scarf, holding a lantern"
        width="270"
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="num">01</span> Quick start</span>
      <h2>From nothing to <em>running</em> in a minute.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="n">01</span>
        <h3>Make a project</h3>
        <p class="muted">A <code>pooka.toml</code>, a <code>src/main.pooka</code> and a first test.</p>
        <pre class="code"><span class="cmd">pooka new lantern</span>
<span class="cmd">cd lantern</span></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="n">02</span>
        <h3>Run it</h3>
        <p class="muted">Dependencies download, modules compile, <code>main()</code> runs.</p>
        <pre class="code"><span class="cmd">pooka run</span>
<span class="cmd">pooka test</span></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="n">03</span>
        <h3>Bring friends</h3>
        <p class="muted">Any Hex package works: Pooka, Erlang, Elixir or Gleam.</p>
        <pre class="code"><span class="cmd">pooka add arglet</span>
<span class="cmd">pooka add cowboy</span></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="num">02</span> A short walk</span>
      <h2>Read it once, <em>remember</em> it.</h2>
      <p>Every example below compiles and runs with Pooka {{ site.params.version }}.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tabs" data-tabs>
      <div class="tab-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Language features">
        <button role="tab" id="t-classes" aria-controls="p-classes" aria-selected="true"><strong>Classes</strong><span>Families and inheritance</span></button>
        <button role="tab" id="t-enums" aria-controls="p-enums" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><strong>Enums &amp; match</strong><span>Every case, handled</span></button>
        <button role="tab" id="t-pipes" aria-controls="p-pipes" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><strong>Pipelines</strong><span>Read in the order it happens</span></button>
        <button
          role="tab"
          id="t-results"
          aria-controls="p-results"
          aria-selected="false"
          tabindex="-1"
        ><strong>Results</strong><span>Errors as values</span></button>
        <button
          role="tab"
          id="t-actors"
          aria-controls="p-actors"
          aria-selected="false"
          tabindex="-1"
        ><strong>Actors</strong><span>State with a letterbox</span></button>
        <button
          role="tab"
          id="t-interop"
          aria-controls="p-interop"
          aria-selected="false"
          tabindex="-1"
        ><strong>Interop</strong><span>Erlang, one line away</span></button>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel window" role="tabpanel" id="p-classes" aria-labelledby="t-classes">
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">classes.pooka</span></div>
        <pre><code class="language-pooka">{{ sample("classes") | safe }}</code></pre>
        <div class="terminal"><pre><code>{{ "$ pooka run\nsrc/main.pooka:27\n\"Ada says hoo\"" | terminal | safe }}</code></pre></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel window" role="tabpanel" id="p-enums" aria-labelledby="t-enums" hidden>
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">enums.pooka</span></div>
        <pre><code class="language-pooka">{{ sample("enums") | safe }}</code></pre>
        <div class="terminal"><pre><code>{{ "$ pooka run\nsrc/main.pooka:18\n\"write a parser\"" | terminal | safe }}</code></pre></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel window" role="tabpanel" id="p-pipes" aria-labelledby="t-pipes" hidden>
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">pipelines.pooka</span></div>
        <pre><code class="language-pooka">{{ sample("pipes") | safe }}</code></pre>
        <div class="terminal"><pre><code>{{ "$ pooka run\nsrc/main.pooka:12\n\"1, 2, 3\"" | terminal | safe }}</code></pre></div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="tab-panel window"
        role="tabpanel"
        id="p-results"
        aria-labelledby="t-results"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">results.pooka</span></div>
        <pre><code class="language-pooka">{{ sample("results") | safe }}</code></pre>
        <div class="terminal"><pre><code>{{ "$ pooka run\nsrc/main.pooka:20\nOk(\"3 cups brewing\")\nsrc/main.pooka:20\nError(\"`lots` is not a number\")" | terminal | safe }}</code></pre></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel window" role="tabpanel" id="p-actors" aria-labelledby="t-actors" hidden>
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">actors.pooka</span></div>
        <pre><code class="language-pooka">{{ sample("actors") | safe }}</code></pre>
        <div class="terminal"><pre><code>{{ "$ pooka run\nsrc/main.pooka:19\n3" | terminal | safe }}</code></pre></div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="tab-panel window"
        role="tabpanel"
        id="p-interop"
        aria-labelledby="t-interop"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">interop.pooka</span></div>
        <pre><code class="language-pooka">{{ sample("interop") | safe }}</code></pre>
        <div class="terminal"><pre><code>{{ "$ pooka run\nsrc/main.pooka:10\n1.4142135623730951\nsrc/main.pooka:11\n3.141592653589793" | terminal | safe }}</code></pre></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-forest">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="window diagnostic">
      <div class="window-bar"><span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="title">pooka build</span></div>
      <pre><code>{{ "error: non-exhaustive match\n   ╭─ src/main.pooka:16:9\n   │\n16 │   match weather {\n   │         ───┬───\n   │            ╰─ not every main.Weather value is handled\n   ╰─\n\nEvery possible value of the matched type must be handled.\n\nhelp: Handle `Weather.Foggy` or add a fallback branch." | terminal | safe }}</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="num">03</span> Diagnostics</span>
      <h2>Errors that <em>help</em>.</h2>
      <p class="muted" style="color: var(--on-dark-muted)">When something is wrong, Pooka points at it, says why, and suggests what to do next.</p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><span class="tick">✓</span><div><strong>Located</strong><span>File, line and column, with the source right there.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="tick">✓</span><div><strong>Explained</strong><span>A sentence about the rule, not just the symptom.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="tick">✓</span><div><strong>Actionable</strong><span>A <code>help:</code> line naming the missing case or the likely fix.</span></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>Light the lantern.</h2>
        <p>Install Pooka, make a project, and say hello to the BEAM. The tour takes an evening; the cookbook is there whenever you're hungry.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-bottom:0">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/install/">Install Pooka</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/cookbook/">Open the cookbook</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/mascots/mascot-waving.png" alt="" width="220">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
